    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Town Speaker of Lonelywood.</strong> Ever since the local inn closed, Nimsy has opened her heated attic to visitors. She bakes halfling-shaped cookies and brings them to meetings of the Council of Speakers.</p>\n<p>Her house was built for humans but most furniture is halfling-sized. Four halfling children \u2014 including <strong>Scoop</strong> \u2014 scamper around with wooden swords.</p>\n<p><strong>Quest hook:</strong> Offers 100 gp for the white moose's head (can be talked up to 125 gp, DC 15 Persuasion). Will also offer Ramshackle as an investment property if pushed further.</p>"
      },
